          "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e7b63b336dd2815668f5df51fbccb0b379252743ad237762b22d8deff73780c9",
          "source_text": "We say that a diagram <MATH_0001> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>codirected<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nor <TEXTITOPEN_0002>cofiltered<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if the following conditions hold:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> the category <MATH_0002> has at least one object,\n<STRUCT_0003> for every pair of objects <MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004>\nthere exist an object <MATH_0005> and morphisms <MATH_0006>,\n<MATH_0007>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for every pair of objects <MATH_0008> of <MATH_0009>\nand every pair of morphisms <MATH_0010> of <MATH_0011>\nthere exists a morphism <MATH_0012> of <MATH_0013>\nsuch that <MATH_0014> as morphisms in <MATH_0015>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nWe say that an index category <MATH_0016> is <TEXTITOPEN_0003>codirected<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>, or\n<TEXTITOPEN_0004>cofiltered<TEXTITCLOSE_0004> if <MATH_0017> is\ncofiltered (in other words you erase the <MATH_0018> in part (3) above).\n",
          "source_text_hash": "sha256:82d3e876f5ca3ccbf10968d019781e0eb00835f7d78b98815fd6cebacb6b9539",
          "unit_id": "tag:04AZ:statement"
        }
